WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:06.360
Freddie loved monster trucks
and dinosaurs.

2
00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:09.600
Big tyres, big roars.

3
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:12.440
Big adventures.

4
00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:15.840
But that Christmas, things
were hard at home.

5
00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:19.520
Freddie's dad had lost his job.

6
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:22.600
And no matter how much
he loved his wee boy,

7
00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.960
he couldn't see how Christmas
would come at all.

8
00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:31.240
Some nights the worry felt
heavier than the house itself,

9
00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:35.120
and the light felt very far away.

10
00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:38.920
Then someone noticed.

11
00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:41.720
Someone cared, and Freddie's

12
00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:45.480
wishes found their way to the
Night Before Christmas Campaign.

13
00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:48.640
Volunteers searched for every roar,

14
00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:51.960
every wheel, every little
piece of wonder.

15
00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:54.160
Not just gifts.

16
00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:56.680
Gifts chosen for him.

17
00:00:56.680 --> 00:00:59.680
A Red Bag Full of Joy.

18
00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:03.600
And on Christmas Eve,
while Freddie slept,

19
00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:06.840
Christmas found its way to his door.

20
00:01:07.720 --> 00:01:12.120
When Freddie woke up, he found
monster trucks, dinosaurs,

21
00:01:12.520 --> 00:01:15.680
and a Christmas morning
he would never forget.

22
00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:19.320
For Freddie, it was magic.

23
00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:23.240
For his dad, it was a hand
reaching through the dark.

24
00:01:24.360 --> 00:01:26.240
He wasn't alone.

25
00:01:26.240 --> 00:01:29.240
His wee boy hadn't been forgotten.

26
00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:33.000
Because even on the darkest night,

27
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:35.520
your kindness can leave a light on.
